        page["title"] = "DValue::set_array"
        page["content"] = "`dval_set_array(value)` makes the target an empty list. It mutates `value` and returns that same identity. All workspace aliases observe the mutation. Assigning the result back remains valid. Later `dval_push` calls use numeric keys from `0`.\n\n## C++ API\n\n`DValue::set_array()` changes the object in place.\n"
