        page["title"] = "DValue::set_type"
        page["content"] = "`dval_set_type(value, type)` changes the target to the specified internal type. It mutates `value` and returns that same identity. All workspace aliases observe the mutation. Assigning the result back remains valid.\n\nUse `dval_set`, `dval_set_bool`, or `dval_set_array` for normal Capy code. Setting map type clears children and resets list state and the next numeric index.\n\n## C++ API\n\n`DValue::set_type()` changes the object in place and can follow an internal reference.\n\n"
